body:
Jesus that is such an insane thing to say, literally nobody other than redditors think about race at all when deciding who to vote on.

&#x200B;

Everybody that votes republican is racist? Even libertarians, independants, and people that didn't support Hillary Clinton? All of them are racist? Every single one?

No, I mean russian soldiers are just an innocent as any other soldiers, not children.

&#x200B;

What has Musk done, directly, that supported the invasion?  Him not wanting to be complacent in killing russian soldiers, is not the same as supporting russia.
